      "status": "height from the owner; position drawn on the platted line",
      "notes": "8 ft horizontal-board privacy fence. Drawn on the platted line; the retail site plan's survey has it on the line at the north end and ~1.6 ft onto the retail tract farther south. A picket fence runs along our south line."
    },
