      "status": "position from the photo, +/-2 m",
      "notes": "The house's electric service: overhead to this pole, then underground to the house along a route not yet located. It's private past the meter, so 811 won't mark it. Have a private locator trace it before digging the north end of the back-line planting, building B's footings or a US-290 wall footing."
    },
